{"chunk_id": "631b06c3-25b9-4f6c-9a10-bb7523277968", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "后端项目面试中，只要你说用了 MQ，面试官很容易追问：消息丢了怎么办？重复消费怎么办？顺序消费怎么保证？延迟消息怎么关闭订单？", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单", "metadata": {"topic": "project", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 63}
{"chunk_id": "8bc05899-8a34-4d78-b2bb-fe42bc36a8e0", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "![mq-retry](./assets/mq-retry.png)", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单", "metadata": {"topic": "mq", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 34}
{"chunk_id": "bc9093b6-9827-4e63-b2cd-62a66f1f5c15", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "![order-timeout](./assets/order-timeout.png)", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单", "metadata": {"topic": "agent_rag", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 44}
{"chunk_id": "bc6cce18-3333-4925-8710-76e151009f1f", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "消息队列常用于异步解耦、削峰填谷、事件驱动。比如用户下单后，不一定同步完成所有操作，可以先创建订单，再通过消息异步处理积分、通知、库存流水等。\n\n但是使用 MQ 会引入新问题：消息可靠性、重复消费、顺序性、积压、死信、最终一致性。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 一、为什么使用消息队列", "metadata": {"topic": "mq", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 115}
{"chunk_id": "ee53d22e-0ec3-4905-885d-217796f4eff0", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "生产者发送消息后，需要确认 broker 收到。broker 需要持久化消息。消费者处理完成后再提交 offset 或 ack。如果中间失败，消息可以重试。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 二、如何保证消息不丢", "metadata": {"topic": "redis", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 78}
{"chunk_id": "a9b67c64-f92a-4100-9a1a-b4b1dcaab857", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "但“保证不丢”通常意味着可能重复，所以消费者必须做幂等。\n\n幂等的核心是：同一条业务消息重复到达，最终结果只能生效一次。常见方案：\n- 数据库唯一键，例如 order_id、request_no、out_trade_no；\n- Redis setnx 去重；\n- 状态机判断，只允许从 INIT 到 SUCCESS；\n- 消费记录表，处理成功后记录 message_id。\n\n例如支付回调：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE orders\nSET status = 'PAID'\nWHERE order_id = ? AND status = 'WAIT_PAY';\n```\n\n这条 SQL 天然带状态判断，多次执行不会重复把订单推进。\n\n如果业务要求同一个订单的事件按顺序处理，可以按 order_id 做分区，让同一个 order_id 的消息进入同一个队列。这样单个队列内保持顺序。\n\n但是全局顺序代价很高，通常没有必要。面试时要区分“局部有序”和“全局有序”。\n\n秒杀或电商场景中，用户下单后 15 分钟不支付，需要关闭订单并回滚库存。可以发送延迟消息，消息到期后检查订单状态：", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 二、如何保证消息不丢", "metadata": {"topic": "mq", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 8}, "char_len": 491}
{"chunk_id": "769f3a8e-a0e5-4160-b931-7f700a13fc4b", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "1. 如果订单仍是 WAIT_PAY，则关闭订单；\n2. 如果已经 PAID，则忽略；\n3. 回滚库存要做幂等，避免重复回滚。\n\n回滚幂等可以用订单状态、库存流水、Redis 标记或数据库唯一键。\n\n消息积压时先判断是生产太快、消费太慢，还是消费者异常。常见处理：\n- 扩容消费者；\n- 临时提升批量消费；\n- 排查慢 SQL / 外部接口；\n- 把大任务拆小；\n- 对死信单独处理。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 五、延迟消息关闭订单", "metadata": {"topic": "mq", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 192}
{"chunk_id": "c6b021fd-6802-4806-85de-e2cf3789a0b0", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 广告与版权\n\n关注小林 coding，回复「MQ」领取消息队列面试题。  \n推荐阅读：图解 RocketMQ、图解 Kafka、图解分布式事务。  \n本文仅用于学习交流，禁止洗稿。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 广告与版权", "metadata": {"topic": "meta", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 93}
